{
  "title": { "zh": "写数据" },
  "after": {
    "zh": "A ∧ B → C 和 A → (B → C) 可以互相改写，这叫<wiki-ref to=\"currying\"></wiki-ref>。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "t-wpair_1",
      "kind": "term",
      "step": { "zh": "第一题" },
      "brief": { "zh": "用下面的块，拼出这句话的证明项。" },
      "premises": { "p": "Rain ∧ Wind → Wet" },
      "goal": "Rain → (Wind → Wet)",
      "answer": "fun a b => p ⟨a, b⟩",
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "拼接写成「⟨□, □⟩」：拿到 a 和 b，拼成一对交给 p。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-wpair_2",
      "kind": "term",
      "step": { "zh": "第二题" },
      "brief": { "zh": "用下面的块，拼出这句话的证明项。" },
      "premises": { "p": "Rain → (Wind → Wet)" },
      "goal": "Rain ∧ Wind → Wet",
      "answer": "fun a => p a.1 a.2",
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "拆解写成「□.1」「□.2」：拿到的 a 是一对，p 要的却是一个一个。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-wpair_3",
      "kind": "term",
      "step": { "zh": "第三题" },
      "brief": { "zh": "用下面的块，拼出这句话的证明项。" },
      "premises": { "p": "Rain ∨ Sat" },
      "goal": "Sat ∨ Rain",
      "answer": "p.elim (fun a => Or.inr a) (fun b => Or.inl b)",
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "分情况写成「□.elim (fun _ => □) (fun _ => □)」，补充写成 Or.inl、Or.inr：每种情况各贴到新「或者」的哪一边？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-wpair_4",
      "kind": "term",
      "step": { "zh": "第四题" },
      "brief": { "zh": "用下面的块，拼出这句话的证明项。" },
      "premises": { "p": "Rain", "q": "¬Rain" },
      "goal": "Rest",
      "answer": "False.elim (q p)",
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "爆炸写成「False.elim □」；q 用在 p 上是矛盾。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
